<div class="listicle-faq-accordion-wrapper">
<details class="listicle-faq-item-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<summary class="listicle-faq-summary-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<span class="listicle-faq-question-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">How quickly does Roli bed ship?</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="listicle-faq-icon-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.71967 8.46967C6.01256 8.17678 6.48744 8.17678 6.78033 8.46967L10.25 11.9393L13.7197 8.46967C14.0126 8.17678 14.4874 8.17678 14.7803 8.46967C15.0732 8.76256 15.0732 9.23744 14.7803 9.53033L10.7803 13.5303C10.4874 13.8232 10.0126 13.8232 9.71967 13.5303L5.71967 9.53033C5.42678 9.23744 5.42678 8.76256 5.71967 8.46967Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path>
</svg>
</span>
</summary>
<div class="listicle-faq-answer-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<div><p>Orders are processed within 24-48 hours. Once your Roli bed is on the way, you'll receive tracking details by email.</p></div>
</div>
</details>
<details class="listicle-faq-item-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<summary class="listicle-faq-summary-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<span class="listicle-faq-question-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">Can I return it if it isn't right for my space?</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="listicle-faq-icon-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.71967 8.46967C6.01256 8.17678 6.48744 8.17678 6.78033 8.46967L10.25 11.9393L13.7197 8.46967C14.0126 8.17678 14.4874 8.17678 14.7803 8.46967C15.0732 8.76256 15.0732 9.23744 14.7803 9.53033L10.7803 13.5303C10.4874 13.8232 10.0126 13.8232 9.71967 13.5303L5.71967 9.53033C5.42678 9.23744 5.42678 8.76256 5.71967 8.46967Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path>
</svg>
</span>
</summary>
<div class="listicle-faq-answer-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<div><p>Yes. Roli bed includes a 30-day money-back guarantee, so you can try it at home and return it if it is not the right fit.</p></div>
</div>
</details>
<details class="listicle-faq-item-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<summary class="listicle-faq-summary-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<span class="listicle-faq-question-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">Are the covers washable?</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="listicle-faq-icon-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.71967 8.46967C6.01256 8.17678 6.48744 8.17678 6.78033 8.46967L10.25 11.9393L13.7197 8.46967C14.0126 8.17678 14.4874 8.17678 14.7803 8.46967C15.0732 8.76256 15.0732 9.23744 14.7803 9.53033L10.7803 13.5303C10.4874 13.8232 10.0126 13.8232 9.71967 13.5303L5.71967 9.53033C5.42678 9.23744 5.42678 8.76256 5.71967 8.46967Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path>
</svg>
</span>
</summary>
<div class="listicle-faq-answer-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<div><p>Yes. The covers are removable and machine washable, making cleanup simple after sleepovers, guests, and everyday lounging.</p></div>
</div>
</details>
<details class="listicle-faq-item-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<summary class="listicle-faq-summary-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<span class="listicle-faq-question-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">What materials are used?</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="listicle-faq-icon-faq_accordion_tyNeAT">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.71967 8.46967C6.01256 8.17678 6.48744 8.17678 6.78033 8.46967L10.25 11.9393L13.7197 8.46967C14.0126 8.17678 14.4874 8.17678 14.7803 8.46967C15.0732 8.76256 15.0732 9.23744 14.7803 9.53033L10.7803 13.5303C10.4874 13.8232 10.0126 13.8232 9.71967 13.5303L5.71967 9.53033C5.42678 9.23744 5.42678 8.76256 5.71967 8.46967Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path>
